{"qid": "mt_00082_t2", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 1, "group_id": "g0082", "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 12753.27, "n_tokens": 208, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.2222222222222222, "refusal": false, "uncertain": true, "answer_len": 313, "slots_inherited_ok": 0, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=False key_recall=0.22", "answer": "关于您追问的“提前退租”问题，我需要先说明：**您提供的参考资料（各判决书）内容高度雷同且不完整，均只截取到“判决如下：一、被告于本判决生效之日起……”即中断，未显示判决主文和具体裁判理由，因此无法从这些参考案例中提炼出针对“提前退租、押金返还”的具体裁判规则。** 以下回答依据现行法律规定，并明确标注不确定之处。\n\n## 一、法律上的基本规则\n\n**1. 合同严守原则**\n《民法典》第四百六十五条规定，依法成立的合同，受法律保护，对当事人具有法律约束力。租期两年是双方约定，承租人因工作调动提前退租，属于单方提前解除合同。\n\n**2. 提前退租的性质**\n- 若合同**约定**了提前退租的条件和违约责任（如“提前退租需", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 12.752, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2022）苏01民再1284号_0", "score": 0.0833, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）苏01民再1284号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）沪01民终1458号_0", "score": 0.0833, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）沪01民终1458号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）京03民初583号_0", "score": 0.0833, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）京03民初583号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）粤03民初1988号_0", "score": 0.0833, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）粤03民初1988号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）苏05民终1686号_0", "score": 0.0833, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）苏05民终1686号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）津02民初2150号_0", "score": 0.0764, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）津02民初2150号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）沪01民再2502号_0", "score": 0.0764, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）沪01民再2502号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2022）苏05民再445号_0", "score": 0.0764, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）苏05民再445号"}]}}}
{"qid": "mt_00067_t2", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 1, "group_id": "g0067", "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 38.12, "n_tokens": 214, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.5, "refusal": false, "uncertain": true, "answer_len": 321, "slots_inherited_ok": 0, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=True key_recall=0.50", "answer": "根据《中华人民共和国民法典》第一千零七十九条，人民法院审理离婚案件，应当进行调解；如果感情确已破裂，调解无效的，应当准予离婚。有下列情形之一，调解无效的，应当准予离婚：（一）重婚或者与他人同居；（二）实施家庭暴力或者虐待、遗弃家庭成员；（三）有赌博、吸毒等恶习屡教不改；（四）因感情不和分居满二年；（五）其他导致夫妻感情破裂的情形。\n\n因此，以感情确已破裂为由起诉离婚，上述条件同样适用。家庭暴力属于法定的、经调解无效即应准予离婚的情形之一。\n\n关于材料准备，法律并未在《民法典》中逐一列举，实务中通常需要：\n1. 起诉状（写明离婚请求、损害赔偿请求、财产分割请求及事实理由）；\n2. 身份证明（身份证、结婚证）；\n3. 感情确已破裂的证据（", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.037, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2023）沪01民初1337号_0", "score": 0.6855, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）沪01民初1337号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）京02民再664号_0", "score": 0.6855, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）京02民再664号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2022）粤01民终346号_0", "score": 0.6844, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）粤01民终346号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）苏01民初2571号_0", "score": 0.6833, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）苏01民初2571号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2022）津02民终665号_0", "score": 0.6822, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）津02民终665号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）京03民再2742号_0", "score": 0.6822, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）京03民再2742号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）京03民终2927号_0", "score": 0.6822, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）京03民终2927号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）沪02民再2610号_0", "score": 0.6822, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）沪02民再2610号"}]}}}
{"qid": "mt_00072_t2", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 1, "group_id": "g0072", "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 39.22, "n_tokens": 204, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.4, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 306, "slots_inherited_ok": 0, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=True key_recall=0.40", "answer": "根据《民法典》第一千零七十九条，人民法院审理离婚案件，应当进行调解；如感情确已破裂，调解无效的，应当准予离婚。该条同时规定，因感情不和分居满二年的，调解无效的，应当准予离婚。\n\n结合您的情况（2019年登记结婚、因性格不合长期分居、涉案金额约247000元、距今约64个月）：\n\n**一、分居规则的适用**\n- 法律上的“分居”须是因**感情不和**而分居，而非因工作、学习等客观原因两地分居。\n- 需**连续分居满二年**。您所述“长期分居”若满足该条件，属于法定应当准予离婚的情形之一。\n- 分居满二年是认定感情破裂的情形之一，并非自动离婚，仍须经诉讼（或调解）程序由法院判决。\n\n**二、需要准备的材料**", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.038, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2023）京02民终1040号_0", "score": 0.6903, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）京02民终1040号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）苏01民再2683号_0", "score": 0.674, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）苏01民再2683号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）沪02民再2640号_0", "score": 0.673, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）沪02民再2640号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）沪01民初1337号_0", "score": 0.6666, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）沪01民初1337号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）苏01民初2571号_0", "score": 0.6646, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）苏01民初2571号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）京03民再2742号_0", "score": 0.6636, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）京03民再2742号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）京03民终2927号_0", "score": 0.6636, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）京03民终2927号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）京02民再664号_0", "score": 0.6597, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）京02民再664号"}]}}}
{"qid": "mt_00062_t2", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 1, "group_id": "g0062", "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 42.22, "n_tokens": 228, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.5238095238095238, "refusal": true, "uncertain": true, "answer_len": 342, "slots_inherited_ok": 0, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=True key_recall=0.52", "answer": "**一、婚前财产是否分割**\n\n不因离婚方式（登记离婚撤回后转诉讼离婚）而改变。依据《民法典》第一千零六十三条第一项，一方的婚前财产为夫妻一方的个人财产，离婚时不参与共同财产分割。你主张婚前个人财产不予分割，有法律依据。\n\n需注意：若婚前财产在婚后发生形态转化（如婚前存款婚后用于购房、婚前房产婚后共同还贷等），转化后的部分可能涉及共同财产认定，需结合具体证据判断。参考资料未涉及此类细节，无法给出确定结论。\n\n**二、关于\"三十日撤回\"的影响**\n\n《民法典》第一千零七十七条规定的三十日离婚冷静期，仅适用于婚姻登记机关的协议离婚程序。一方撤回申请后，另一方直接提起离婚诉讼，不受该撤回行为影响，法院仍按诉讼离婚规则审理（《民法典》第一千零七十九条）。\n\n**三、建议准备的材料**", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.041, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_1063", "score": 0.6526, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 1063, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_1062", "score": 0.2608, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 1062, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）沪02民再2610号_0", "score": 0.2489, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）沪02民再2610号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）沪01民初2501号_0", "score": 0.2435, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）沪01民初2501号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2022）粤01民再1852号_0", "score": 0.2435, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）粤01民再1852号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）闽01民初2553号_0", "score": 0.2427, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）闽01民初2553号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）沪02民再2000号_0", "score": 0.2423, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）沪02民再2000号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）粤03民终1665号_0", "score": 0.1896, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）粤03民终1665号"}]}}}
{"qid": "mt_00054_t2", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 1, "group_id": "g0054", "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 46.12, "n_tokens": 208, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.35, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 312, "slots_inherited_ok": 0, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=True key_recall=0.35", "answer": "根据您描述的情况（2021年登记结婚、育有一子、因性格不合长期分居、一方起诉离婚并主张抚养权、另一方主张分割房产），结合参考资料，回答如下：\n\n**一、是否准予离婚**\n\n《民法典》第一千零七十九条规定：人民法院审理离婚案件，应当进行调解；感情确已破裂、调解无效的，应当准予离婚。因感情不和分居满二年，调解无效的，应当准予离婚。\n\n需注意：您提到\"长期分居\"，但法律上以\"因感情不和分居满二年\"作为法定离婚情形之一，需满足分居原因（感情不和）与分居时长（满二年）两个条件。若分居未满二年，法院仍会综合判断感情是否确已破裂。\n\n**二、子女抚养**\n\n《民法典》第一千零八十四条规定：离婚后，不满两周岁的子女，以由母亲直接抚养", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.044, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2025）京02民再664号_0", "score": 0.6833, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）京02民再664号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）京02民初502号_0", "score": 0.6833, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）京02民初502号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）苏05民再1453号_0", "score": 0.6812, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）苏05民再1453号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）京03民再2742号_0", "score": 0.6802, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）京03民再2742号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）沪01民终2135号_0", "score": 0.6764, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）沪01民终2135号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）京02民初443号_0", "score": 0.6764, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）京02民初443号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）京02民再413号_0", "score": 0.6764, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）京02民再413号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）沪01民初2501号_0", "score": 0.6764, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）沪01民初2501号"}]}}}
{"qid": "mt_00093_t2", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 1, "group_id": "g0093", "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 40.44, "n_tokens": 230, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.5555555555555556, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 345, "slots_inherited_ok": 0, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=True key_recall=0.56", "answer": "关于您追问的两个问题，分别说明如下：\n\n**一、转租情形下租赁合同的效力与解除**\n\n1. **合同效力**：承租人未经出租人同意转租的，转租合同本身并非当然无效，但出租人享有法定解除权。\n\n2. **法律依据**：《民法典》第七百一十六条第二款规定：\"承租人未经出租人同意转租的，出租人可以解除合同。\"即出租人可据此主张解除其与承租人之间的租赁合同。\n\n3. **解除后的责任**：合同解除后，承租人应返还房屋，并依《民法典》第五百七十七条承担违约责任、赔偿损失。损失范围一般包括租金损失、房屋损坏修复费用等，需以实际损失为限并举证证明。\n\n**二、关于您提到的\"52个月\"（约4年4个月）**\n\n这涉及**诉讼时效**问题。《民法典》第一百八十八条规定，向人民法院请求保护民事权利的诉讼", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.039, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2019）沪01民终931号_0", "score": 0.0921, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）沪01民终931号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）京03民终2930号_0", "score": 0.0921, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）京03民终2930号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）津02民初2135号_0", "score": 0.0855, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）津02民初2135号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）沪02民再2661号_0", "score": 0.0855, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）沪02民再2661号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2022）津02民再1631号_0", "score": 0.0855, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）津02民再1631号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2022）京03民初1325号_0", "score": 0.0855, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）京03民初1325号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）津02民初1536号_0", "score": 0.0855, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）津02民初1536号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）渝01民初352号_0", "score": 0.0855, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）渝01民初352号"}]}}}
{"qid": "mt_00053_t2", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 1, "group_id": "g0053", "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 43.13, "n_tokens": 229, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.35, "refusal": false, "uncertain": true, "answer_len": 344, "slots_inherited_ok": 0, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=True key_recall=0.35", "answer": "关于您追问的两个问题，分别说明如下：\n\n**一、感情破裂的认定**\n\n《民法典》第一千零七十九条第二款规定：\"人民法院审理离婚案件，应当进行调解；如果感情确已破裂，调解无效的，应当准予离婚。\"该条第三款列举了应准予离婚的情形，包括：重婚或与他人同居、实施家庭暴力或虐待遗弃家庭成员、有赌博吸毒等恶习屡教不改、因感情不和分居满二年，以及其他导致夫妻感情破裂的情形。\n\n需要说明的是：**撤回离婚登记申请本身，并不等于感情破裂的认定依据**。一方在三十日冷静期内撤回申请，只是终止了协议离婚程序，不影响另一方另行起诉离婚的权利。法院仍会依据上述法定标准，结合具体证据独立判断感情是否确已破裂。\n\n**二、需要准备的材料**\n\n结合您提到的\"主张婚前个人财产不予分割\"，建议准备：\n\n1. **", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.042, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2022）川01民再2531号_0", "score": 0.0878, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）川01民再2531号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）闽01民初2553号_0", "score": 0.0878, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）闽01民初2553号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）苏05民再1453号_0", "score": 0.0878, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）苏05民再1453号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）苏01民初2571号_0", "score": 0.0878, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）苏01民初2571号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）苏05民初139号_0", "score": 0.0878, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）苏05民初139号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）苏05民再2737号_0", "score": 0.0878, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）苏05民再2737号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）京03民再2742号_0", "score": 0.0878, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）京03民再2742号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）粤01民初1215号_0", "score": 0.0878, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）粤01民初1215号"}]}}}
{"qid": "mt_00081_t2", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 1, "group_id": "g0081", "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 39.14, "n_tokens": 218, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.5, "refusal": false, "uncertain": true, "answer_len": 328, "slots_inherited_ok": 0, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=True key_recall=0.50", "answer": "关于您追问的两个问题，分别说明如下：\n\n**一、未经同意转租时，租赁合同的效力与解除**\n\n1. **合同本身仍然有效。** 转租未经出租人同意，并不导致原租赁合同无效。原租赁合同对出租人和承租人继续具有法律约束力。\n\n2. **出租人享有解除权。** 依据《民法典》第七百一十六条第二款：承租人未经出租人同意转租的，出租人可以解除合同。这是出租人的法定解除权。\n\n3. **解除权受除斥期间限制。** 依据《民法典》第七百一十八条：出租人知道或者应当知道承租人转租，但在六个月内未提出异议的，视为出租人同意转租。也就是说，出租人主张解除，原则上应在其知道或应当知道转租之日起六个月内提出；超过六个月未提异议的，视为同意，解除权可能因此丧失。\n\n4. **", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.038, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2022）苏01民初1084号_0", "score": 0.0921, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）苏01民初1084号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）京01民初2078号_0", "score": 0.0921, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）京01民初2078号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）沪02民再2661号_0", "score": 0.0855, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）沪02民再2661号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）津02民初2135号_0", "score": 0.0855, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）津02民初2135号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2022）津02民再1631号_0", "score": 0.0855, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）津02民再1631号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）津02民初1536号_0", "score": 0.0855, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）津02民初1536号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）沪02民再2641号_0", "score": 0.0855, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）沪02民再2641号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）京02民再671号_0", "score": 0.0855, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）京02民再671号"}]}}}
{"qid": "mt_00073_t2", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 1, "group_id": "g0073", "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 37.82, "n_tokens": 220, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.4, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 331, "slots_inherited_ok": 0, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=True key_recall=0.40", "answer": "起诉离婚同样适用《民法典》第一千零七十九条规定的规则，即人民法院审理离婚案件应当先行调解；感情确已破裂、调解无效的，应当准予离婚。您提到的\"感情确已破裂\"和\"家庭暴力\"情形，正是该条规定的可以认定感情破裂、应准予离婚的法定情形之一。\n\n关于需要准备的材料，结合您描述的情况（主张家庭暴力、请求损害赔偿并在财产分割中照顾），一般包括：\n\n1. **起诉状**：写明离婚请求、子女抚养、财产分割、损害赔偿等诉讼请求及事实理由。\n2. **身份与婚姻关系证明**：身份证、结婚证（或婚姻登记记录证明）。\n3. **感情破裂的证据**：如分居证明、沟通记录等。\n4. **家庭暴力的证据**（针对您的主张）：报警记录、伤情鉴定、医院诊疗记录、告诫书、证人证言、录音录像等", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.037, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2023）沪01民初1337号_0", "score": 0.6921, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）沪01民初1337号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）苏01民初2571号_0", "score": 0.6898, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）苏01民初2571号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）京03民终2927号_0", "score": 0.6887, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）京03民终2927号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）京03民再2742号_0", "score": 0.6887, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）京03民再2742号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）沪01民终2135号_0", "score": 0.6855, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）沪01民终2135号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）京02民再413号_0", "score": 0.6855, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）京02民再413号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）京02民初443号_0", "score": 0.6855, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）京02民初443号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2022）粤01民终346号_0", "score": 0.6844, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）粤01民终346号"}]}}}
{"qid": "mt_00002_t2", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 1, "group_id": "g0002", "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 37.44, "n_tokens": 236, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.55, "refusal": true, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 354, "slots_inherited_ok": 0, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=False key_recall=0.55", "answer": "根据你描述的情况（朋友关系、银行转账101000元、无书面合同、未约定利息、逾期未还），本金和利息的规则如下：\n\n## 一、本金能否主张返还\n\n**可以主张返还本金。**\n\n《民法典》第六百七十五条规定：借款人应当按照约定的期限返还借款。对借款期限没有约定或者约定不明确，依据本法第五百一十条的规定仍不能确定的，借款人可以随时返还；贷款人可以催告借款人在合理期限内返还。\n\n本案中，虽无书面合同，但银行转账凭证可以证明款项实际交付，结合双方陈述可认定借贷合意，借款人应当返还本金。\n\n## 二、利息（资金占用损失）规则\n\n**未约定利息的，借期内不计算利息；但逾期后可主张资金占用损失。**\n\n- 《民法典》第六百八十条第二款规定：借款合同对支付利息没有约定的，视为没有利息。\n- 《最高人民法院关于审理民间", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.037, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2021）沪02民初398号_0", "score": 0.0857, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）沪02民初398号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2022）沪02民再1462号_0", "score": 0.0857, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）沪02民再1462号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）沪02民再667号_0", "score": 0.0857, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）沪02民再667号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）沪01民再3053号_0", "score": 0.0786, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）沪01民再3053号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）沪02民再3009号_0", "score": 0.0786, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）沪02民再3009号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2022）沪01民再1266号_0", "score": 0.0786, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）沪01民再1266号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）津02民初1653号_0", "score": 0.0786, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）津02民初1653号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）沪01民再2485号_0", "score": 0.0786, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）沪01民再2485号"}]}}}
